<p><%= mail_greeting %></p>
<p>Someone tried to open one of your shared form links, but your account cannot accept new documents right now, so they saw a "not accepting responses" page instead of the form.</p>
<% case @reason %>
<% when 'completions' %>
  <p>Why: the account has used all <%= @limits.completions_per_month %> document completions included in the free plan this month. The limit resets on <%= @resets_at.strftime('%-d %B %Y') %> at 00:00 UTC, and the link will work again by itself.</p>
<% when 'sends' %>
  <p>Why: the account has sent <%= @limits.sends_per_month %> documents this month, the free plan's limit. The limit resets on <%= @resets_at.strftime('%-d %B %Y') %> at 00:00 UTC, and the link will work again by itself.</p>
<% when 'in_flight' %>
  <p>Why: the account has <%= @limits.in_flight %> documents waiting for signatures, the free plan's limit. The link will work again as soon as some of them are completed, declined or deleted.</p>
<% when 'sending_paused' %>
  <p>Why: sending is paused on this account while we review a delivery problem. See the separate email about that pause, or contact <%= mail_to @support_email %>.</p>
<% end %>
<% unless @reason == 'sending_paused' %>
  <p>The paid plan removes the free limits: $10 per user per month, with a 14-day free trial.</p>
<% end %>
<p><%= link_to 'See your usage', @usage_url %></p>
<p>Thanks,<br>EsignCenter</p>
